===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂er-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|art}}, from {{der|en|fro|art}}, from {{der|en|la|artem}}, accusative of {{m|la|ars||art}}. Partly displaced native {{noncog|ang|cræft}}, whence {{w|Modern English}} {{m|en|craft}}.

